Z||000009||ka4nkf||02-03-2001||11:31 PM||||Don;t Forget to check the pigtail connector at the battery harness. there will be a red wire (pigtale) from the wiring harness. make sure it is connected. this is what feeds the ECM memory.||||reg||1
